Thoron: vendor adblock-rust and the crates it needs (native ad blocking).

Adds adblock 0.13.3 (MPL-2.0) and its dependencies to Chromium's Rust crates: Cargo.toml, the
pinned and checksummed Cargo.lock, gnrt_config.toml entries and two crate patches (the MIT text that
seahash does not ship; FlatBuffers never enabling nightly-only features). regex and aho-corasick are
allowed outside tests: memory-safe Rust with linear-time matching. regex is also named as a direct
dependency, so that the engine's own code may use it (the expressions of `$urlskip` rules). The crate
sources and their
BUILD.gn files are produced by tools/build/rust_crates.py in the Thoron repository (gnrt vendor and gen).

Origin: Thoron
Author: KuchiSofts
License: BSD-3-Clause

